  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fried dough brings back the magic of summer fairs with every golden, crispy bite. Soft, pillowy pastry fries to perfection, dusted with sugar and filled with warm, nostalgic sweetness. Made from simple pantry staples and kissed with vanilla and cinnamon, it’s pure comfort in minutes. Finished with a drizzle of honey or fruity compote, this easy treat delivers crunch, joy, and childhood smiles in every bite.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-fried-dough\">Why You’ll Love This fried dough</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-fried-dough\">How to Make Fried Dough</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-fried-dough\">Pro Tips for Making Fried Dough</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-fried-dough\">How to Serve this fried dough</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-fried-dough\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This fried dough</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>It&#8217;s a delightful treat that brings back childhood memories.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick and easy to make with simple ingredients.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfectly crispy on the outside, soft on the inside.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite toppings or dips.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>A fun activity to enjoy with family and friends!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-10826\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"10826\" data-servings=\"8\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-contain